== AS-IS

+ 🔴 `crates/mindtape/src/sort.rs` names `config.query.default_sort` twice. The key is `config.ls.default_sort`.
+ 🔴 `crates/mindtape/src/date/mod.rs` names `crate::date_pin`. The module is `crate::date::pin`.
+ 🔴 Three module headers list `cmd/ls/interactive/tests.rs` as their own tests. The file belongs to `cmd/ls/interactive`.
+ 🔴 `crates/mindtape-cli/tests/it/config_schema_validate.rs` says four hand-written `JsonSchema` implementations. There are seven.

== TO-BE

- 🟢 Every comment states the true path, the true count and the true test file.
- 🟢 The Commits style refuses a `Co-Authored-By` trailer and a `Generated by` line.

```text
